TY  - JOUR
T1  - A survey on retrieval-augmentation generation (RAG) models for healthcare applications
A1  - Abo El-Enen, Mohamed
A1  - Saad, Sally
A1  - Nazmy, Taymoor
Y1  - 2025/11//
KW  - Contrastive language-image pre-training
KW  - Generative AI
